{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28556","headline":"歙州卢中丞见惠名醖 · 杜牧","name":"歙州卢中丞见惠名醖","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谁怜贱子啓穷途，太守封来酒一壶。\n攻破是非浑似梦，削平身世有如无。\n醺醺若借嵇康懒，兀兀仍添甯武愚。\n犹念悲秋更分赐，夹溪红蓼映风蒲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28556.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28556","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}